    "detailed_description": "<strong>Put your skills to the test with &quot;Currently Unstable&quot;! Transfer electricity from the Main Generator to the Power Core in this fun, challenging game. Test new components, connect them wisely, and see how electricity flows. Whether in a busy warehouse or a cozy room, watch everything light up.</strong><br><br><u><strong>Your goal is simple yet challenging:</strong></u><br><strong>transfer electricity from the Main Generator to the Power Core. </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532270/extras/ab9faa27134997daac20647e55c96563.poster.avif?t=1724226938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532270/extras/ab9faa27134997daac20647e55c96563.webm?t=1724226938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532270/extras/ab9faa27134997daac20647e55c96563.mp4?t=1724226938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>Test new components and understand how they work.</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532270/extras/11c1e43c2076e1466741cbb5c5ffee70.poster.avif?t=1724226938\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532270/extras/11c1e43c2076e1466741cbb5c5ffee70.webm?t=1724226938\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2532270/extras/11c1e43c2076e1466741cbb5c5ffee70.mp4?t=1724226938\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><u><strong>Strategically place objects on the map, connect and create circuits.</strong></u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: